  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Electrons must be removed from the outermost orbital to form an ion.</p><p>The electronic configurations of the elements are as follows,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>Cr</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>24</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mo>→</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>;</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mi>Cr</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>Mn</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>25</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mo>→</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>;</mo><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>Ni</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>28</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mo>→</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>;</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mi>Ni</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>8</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mo> </mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>23</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mo> </mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>;</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p><p>Hence option B is the answer.</p>",
